      📜 4. Core Company Policies & Rules
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- MODULE 1: WHO WE ARE & STORY -->
  <div id="obTabContent-story" class="ob-tab-panel active">
    <div class="panel">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <img class="hero-logo" src="assets/cabella-logo.png" alt="Cabella" style="max-height:55px">
        <div>
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 4px">Who We Are — Las Vegas Wholesale Building Supplies</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="margin:0">Supplying professional contractors, builders, investors, property managers, and developers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Cabella opened in 2025 with a simple goal: give professional customers one dependable, high-speed wholesale source for ready-to-assemble (RTA) cabinets, prefabricated stone countertops, LVP flooring, sinks, hardware, and related materials.</p>
      <div class="notice" style="background:#eff6ff;border-color:#3b82f6;color:#1e3a8a;margin-top:14px">
        💡 <strong>The Cabella Showroom Concept:</strong> Our showroom is <em>not</em> a traditional retail store for walk-in homeowners. It is an extension of our contractor customers' businesses. Contractors can make appointments, bring clients to view samples, review 2D/3D layouts and renderings, and finalize selections smoothly.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Products We Supply</span>
        <h3>What We Sell</h3>
        <p>RTA cabinets, prefabricated quartz/granite stone countertops, SPC luxury vinyl plank flooring, undermount sinks, cabinet hardware, butcher blocks, and trim accessories.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Target Audience</span>
        <h3>Who We Serve</h3>
        <p>Licensed contractors, commercial builders, real estate investors, property management companies, developers, and trade professionals.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Supply & Logistics</span>
        <h3>How We Work</h3>
        <p>We supply materials, coordinate purchasing/transportation, assist with measurements/renderings, and keep projects moving on schedule. We do <strong>not</strong> provide installation services.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" style="margin-top:20px">
      <h2>Leadership & Key Team Directory</h2>
      <div class="two">
        <div>
          <p><strong>Edwin Portillo</strong> — Chief Executive Officer (CEO)</p>
          <p><strong>Gil Sirimarco</strong> — Chief Financial Officer (CFO)</p>
          <p><strong>Jerry Maza</strong> — Head Project Manager</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p><strong>Mayra Rodriguez</strong> — Orders Coordinator</p>
          <p><strong>Chuy</strong> — Warehouse Manager</p>
          <button class="btn secondary" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="show('directory')">📞 Open Staff Directory & RingCentral</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="continue" style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end">
      <button class="btn" onclick="switchOnboardingTab('roadmap')">Next Step: Day 1 & First Week Roadmap →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MODULE 2: DAY 1 & FIRST WEEK ROADMAP -->
  <div id="obTabContent-roadmap" class="ob-tab-panel">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>🚀 First-Week PM & Employee Learning Roadmap</h2>
      <p class="lead">Follow this structured path during your first 7 days at Cabella:</p>
      
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:16px">
        <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px">
          <strong>Day 1: Identity & Communication Tools</strong>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Set up RingCentral extension, confirm Gmail access, and practice searching the CSE Knowledge Base for instant answers.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #10b981;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px">
          <strong>Day 2: File Storage & Jobsite Folders</strong>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Navigate Google Shared Drive (<code>Cabella Client Projects</code>). Understand how floor plans, top views, and renderings are stored by Jobsite Address.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px">
          <strong>Day 3: QuickBooks Projects & Estimating</strong>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Learn how to create customer estimates, issue invoices, and understand customer pricing tiers (Select, Plus, Premier).</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #8b5cf6;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px">
          <strong>Day 4: Supplier Quote Requests & Purchase Orders</strong>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Learn to request vendor quotes, compare stock lead times, and generate vendor POs inside QB Projects after 100% customer payment.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #ec4899;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px">
          <strong>Day 5–7: Warehouse Receiving & Customer Pickup</strong>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Coordinate order arrival with Orders Coordinator (Mayra) & Warehouse Manager (Chuy). Ensure pickup waiver signatures and photos are attached to QB invoices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

