  <!-- MODULE 4: CORE COMPANY POLICIES & RULES -->
  <div id="obTabContent-policies" class="ob-tab-panel">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>📜 Core Company Rules & Operating Policies</h2>
      <p class="lead">Non-negotiable standards for all Cabella employees and Project Managers:</p>

      <ol style="line-height:1.7;font-size:15px;padding-left:20px">
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Search CSE Knowledge Base First:</strong> Before asking a supervisor or coworker a routine procedure or price question, search CSE first.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Jobsite Address Naming Rule:</strong> All projects, Google Drive folders, QuickBooks Projects, estimates, and POs must strictly be named by the <strong>Jobsite Address</strong>.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Individual Supplier Quotes:</strong> Request quotes from individual approved vendors (Grandwood, HomeCo, MSI, etc.) and compare availability and shipping lead time.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>100% Payment Mandate Before PO:</strong> Never place a supplier Purchase Order until the customer has explicitly approved the estimate and paid the invoice in full.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Return & Restocking Policy:</strong> Eligible returns carry a minimum <strong>$75 restocking fee</strong>. Always verify terms on <code>CabellaCollections.com</code> before promising a return or fee waiver.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Jobsite Measurement Disclaimer:</strong> Contractors and customers are solely responsible for final jobsite measurements and dimensions. Cabella provides layout assistance based on customer-provided figures.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Pickup Documentation Mandate:</strong> Warehouse releases require customer sign-off photos and signed pickup waivers attached directly to the connected QuickBooks invoice.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" style="margin-top:20px">
      <h2>Pricing Policies Reference</h2>
      <p>Need details on customer pricing tiers (Select, Plus, Premier) or material markup rules?</p>
      <button class="btn" onclick="show('policies')">Open Pricing Policies & Rules View</button>
    </div>

    <div class="continue" style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between">
      <button class="btn secondary" onclick="switchOnboardingTab('workflow')">← Previous: 9-Step Workflow</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="show('home')">🏠 Return to Home Command Center</button>
    </div>
  </div>
