  <div class="hero"><h1>Cabella Select Quote Tool</h1><p class="lead">Instant estimate generator and pricing tool for Cabella Select Tier cabinets. Use this tool for fast contractor proposals and high-volume project pricing.</p><div class="actions" style="margin-top:16px"><a href="https://cabella-select-quote.netlify.app/" target="_blank" class="btn" style="font-size:16px;padding:12px 20px">🚀 Launch Cabella Select Quote Tool (New Window) ↗</a><button class="btn secondary" onclick="show('pricing')">View Full Cabinet Price Lookup</button></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Select Tier Pricing Guidelines</h2><p><strong>Cabella Select Tier</strong> is optimized for our highest-volume contractors, property management companies, multi-family builders, and commercial investors. Prices reflect volume discount structures for RTA cabinet lines.</p><div class="two" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="fact"><b>Valid Period</b>Estimates generated in the Select Quote Tool are valid for 7 calendar days.</div><div class="fact"><b>Payment Mandate</b>Full 100% payment is required before purchase orders are submitted to suppliers.</div><div class="fact"><b>Excel Download</b>You can also download raw pricing sheets in the Cabinet Price Lookup tool.</div><div class="fact"><b>Questions?</b>Contact CFO Gil Sirimarco (Ext. 101) or CEO Edwin Portillo (Ext. 103).</div></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Embedded Select Estimator Workspace</h2><div style="width:100%;height:680px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#fcfdfe;display:flex;flex-direction:column"><div style="background:#061a33;color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><span>Cabella Select Quote Web Tool — cabella-select-quote.netlify.app</span><a href="https://cabella-select-quote.netlify.app/" target="_blank" style="color:#e5b85f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold">Open Fullscreen ↗</a></div><iframe src="https://cabella-select-quote.netlify.app/" style="width:100%;height:100%;border:0" title="Cabella Select Quote Tool"></iframe></div></div>
