        <div>
          <span class="badge" style="background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; font-weight: bold">Live General Ledger Sync</span>
          <h2 style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 20px; color: #0f172a">Profit and Loss Statement (P&L)</h2>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b">Cabella Collections LLC · Year-to-Date (YTD)</div>
